Z||000000||Lore||04-20-2001||11:00 PM||||This is a great forum.  I love it<P>I used to have a black 87 GT with a superchip and a K&N Airfilter.  Then I moved to Japan and had to sell it.  I'm moving back to the states to San Diego in about 3 months, and after seeing this forum and remembering how fun that car was, i'm buying another.  A black 87 GT with 45k miles on it.  5-speed (has to be a stick), cd player, sunrood, pwr everything, $4100.  <P>My first plans for mods include another K&N airfilter, bored out throttle body, underdrive pulleys, Ground Control Suspension coilovers for a 1" drop, koni shocks and struts, and 17" rims with 235 40's for tires, and a short shifter.  I can't wait.<P>Lore||||reg||1
